    "v2Q1": {
      "fill": "teal",
      "page": "screens",
      "size": 24,
      "text": "Home and History\n\nLook: A · Instrument (chosen). Each board still has Mode (auto, light, dark) in its Tweaks; the Look tweak keeps Crema for reference. In Play, the tab bar, rows and back links move between boards.\n\nHome: the dial-in card for the open bag (Tweak bagState: dialling / dialled), with the best recipe and 'Repeat'.\nHistory: each first drip is read against the bag's window (on time / fast / slow). Shot detail shows the taste triangle, the reading, and what the shot taught the app.\nCompare is a mode you switch on, then pick A and B.",
      "w": 380,
      "x": 1880,
      "y": 0
    },
    "v2Q2": {
      "fill": "teal",
      "page": "screens",
      "size": 24,
      "text": "Brew: the app reads the shot and points the way\n\n• Beans: 'Before you grind' pointer, where the grinder gets adjusted (Tweak pointer: last-shot / age-drift / none). Set 6.2 makes it the default; ✕ or 'Not for this bag' hides it.\n• Shot complete: taste triangle (Sour, Sweet, Bitter) and strength, both prefilled from the last Guji shot. The timing reading compares first drip with the bag's learned window (Tweak reading: on time / fast / slow).\n• One pointer at most, only when taste or timing calls for it: grind finer or coarser, longer or shorter ratio, puck prep for sour + bitter, or 'taste and timing disagree'. Try sweet / sour / bitter with each reading.\n• Score dial, flavour notes, better/worse, equipment and tags as before; Save is never blocked.",
      "w": 400,
      "x": 2820,
      "y": 2200
    },
    "v2Q3": {
      "fill": "teal",
      "page": "screens",
      "size": 24,
      "text": "Setup\n\n• Brew flow: phases, microphone, and the pointer switch with 'reset hidden pointers'.\n• Shot: first-drip target (6–9 s), used for a new bag until the app has learned its own window.\n• Pack: 'What the app learned': dial-in 2 of 3, best recipe, sweet spot 6.2–6.3, step size 0.1 ≈ 1.0 s, first-drip window, notes by setting, age. Reset after a big change.\n• Finish a bag by hand, with an optional 'buy again' rating.",
      "w": 380,
      "x": 2820,
      "y": 4960
    },
    "v2Q4": {
      "fill": "teal",
      "page": "screens",
      "size": 24,
      "text": "Setup, continued\n\n• Grinders: what the app learned per bag (step size and sweet spot on Guji; not enough data yet for the C40).\n• Containers: nearest wins; same weight = conflict; within 3 g = a dismissible warning. One cup can serve Beans and Grind.\n• Tags: one list; the groups only sort it.",
      "w": 380,
      "x": 1880,
      "y": 8000
    },
